    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Penny",
      "key": "summer_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "$d bus#I heard you were responsible for fixing the bus back up. Thank you.|My mother used to drive the bus to Calico Desert... but the bus stopped working a few years ago. Mayor says there's not enough money in the town coffers, or else he'd have it fixed.$u",
      "translation": "$d bus#Slyšela jsem, že za opravu autobusu vděčíme tobě. Děkuji.|Moje máma kdysi řídila autobus do pouště Calico... ale před několika lety přestal fungovat. Starosta říká, že v městské pokladně není dost peněz, jinak by ho nechal opravit.$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "8e802e6eece470c3c3cab23725cee5f79d93c346a2db7444ae42d47abc5e19bc",
      "translationSHA256": "49319355f9fc254c1cc18cd3b04548355ba9c8eceb2561064f9728bc6a8876df",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Penny",
      "key": "summer_Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "So... do you like to decorate your farm house?#$e#It must be nice having your own place to decorate.",
      "translation": "Takže... baví tě zdobit svůj dům na farmě?#$e#Musí být hezké mít vlastní místo, které si můžeš vyzdobit.",
      "sourceSHA256": "089923b604464af3a723dee5a11a8d5144f6a37f709445a7ecd71f2f76fb45ac",
      "translationSHA256": "e482205c0c6c082192e88fbd97900d78479097d120cecfe96f0e1cc86c5f364c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Penny",
      "key": "summer_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hello. Ummm...$u#$b#The mountains look nice today, don't they?$u",
      "translation": "Ahoj. Ehm...$u#$b#Hory dnes vypadají krásně, viď?$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "940bf6d527b24c52b8195e0d720025dd30825c5a4cc7c289195c4fe281a24d2a",
      "translationSHA256": "bfb764bfe6c1466ec4f567f2a40f408cfbef97c5231ae38c61b7c38ff3d0b283",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Penny",
      "key": "fall_Mon",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hi... Um, are you doing okay?$u",
      "translation": "Ahoj... Ehm, daří se ti dobře?$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "b2aa17b6741f581f0fc917066d0de3021e60c84b8b246e9d78b33c0a55fe5cb9",
      "translationSHA256": "64c505088284e710666e10096036ef404a0e9ecb8a8a0ab72344fbb751cb84ed",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Penny",
      "key": "fall_Mon4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "It's kind of embarrassing to be the only family in town who lives in a trailer.$u#$e#I wish I could live in a nice house, someday.$s",
      "translation": "Je trochu trapné být jedinou rodinou ve městě, která žije v karavanu.$u#$e#Kéž bych jednou mohla bydlet v pěkném domě.$s",
      "sourceSHA256": "1bb6b60c96681f8b2b6fb81816a33b33f8e9e14906f4a9c3a23438a51bf47b92",
      "translationSHA256": "dc16636e3e99ebe6f0f41e4334596a7030584a770a8293a807bd247687d224e0",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
