    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Penny",
      "key": "fall_Fri6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "When I was a little girl, my father abandoned us because he said he felt 'trapped'. We haven't seen him since.$s#$b#I'm sorry to make things uncomfortable for you... It's just that this time of year makes me think of it for some reason.$u#$e#Anyway... How's the farming life going?",
      "translation": "Když jsem byla malá, táta nás opustil, protože se prý cítil ‚v pasti‘. Od té doby jsme ho neviděly.$s#$b#Promiň, jestli ti je to nepříjemné... Tohle období mi to z nějakého důvodu připomíná.$u#$e#Ale dost o tom... Jak se ti daří na farmě?",
      "sourceSHA256": "7fb76a6989258b5b68bf901399820a59276eb4dcb64b3b2f76c67c88456f7cdc",
      "translationSHA256": "cfc5d94a40d8d49157963301c31fe5188a2041a324bc1cf9447628b78f5fc331",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Penny",
      "key": "fall_Sun10",
      "field": null,
      "source": "@! I was just thinking about the future...#$e#Where do you picture yourself in ten years?$l#$e#I have a few ideas for myself...$u",
      "translation": "@! Zrovna jsem přemýšlela o budoucnosti...#$e#Kde se vidíš za deset let?$l#$e#Já mám o své budoucnosti pár představ...$u",
      "sourceSHA256": "28e81f1de7b694a90e08f0312f0338364b139ebe269008c64eebc119101af250",
      "translationSHA256": "3f22cfc7cb9f37f334fc5e88a949dae995aec1f456b6fb3edeb1a11f21627f11",
